> The orange potion shatters...
> ...
> and so on
>
>
> [1] Probably weight >= 2600 to cover dragons, mastadons
> and wumpii?? etc. but exclude centaurs or smaller.

   Wumpuses, not wumpii; but actually they're smaller than centaurs,
according to the code. (Yeah, I don't believe it, either!) But 2600
does look like the magic number. So here's a rudimentary patch.
Apparently I'm in a patchy mood today! ;)
   Sorry about the non-standard format of the patch; my Nethack source
is all patched up already, including the "sit on a pit" patch included
in the sit.c code below because I'm too lazy to get rid of it. So
this patch was kind of stitched together by hand.
   Note that if you #sit on an object, you don't lay eggs. I guess
this makes sense, although it might make more sense to be able to
lay eggs as long as you weren't "not very comfortable" (and weren't
crushing things under you, I guess!).

-Arthur


